config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_212_VELA_HUB
	bool "Contest 2026 team 212 VelaMesh fusion hub (R528)"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable the VelaMesh (枢络) R528 main-control fusion node
		application.

		Subscribes to edge-node MQTT evidence topics (face embeddings,
		gait silhouettes, BLE proximity), fuses multimodal identity
		evidence into identity/access decisions, and triggers Skills.

		Stage 1 builds a stub main loop; MQTT subscription, the fusion
		engine and Skill triggers are filled in by follow-up tasks.
